but also getting for it will win it will always win yes and then this notion of home being a not quite a permanent thing although you know one of the things that people always get upset about if you live in new york city and then you watch shows about new york city that the apartments are too big for the income bracket of the people living in them yeah There's a Peter Hedges movie that our friend Katie Holmes started and called pieces of April, which if you haven't seen that movie is a fantastic movie.
